   "why": "REJECT: autowire_all wired ctrl_l.m1_out (a motor-drive OUTPUT, role=source, screw-terminal) into ctrl_r.power_in and vice versa. Electrically nonsense: a PWM motor output must not feed a controller supply input. It only matched on port type + source/sink roles. Undo and wire explicitly.",
